'''Sacred Villages''' were areas located on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Jakku]].<ref name="Survival" /> One of them, [[Tuanul]], was populated by members of the [[Church of the Force]], who eschewed modern technology and instead created their own in order to bring themselves more in touch with nature.<ref name="Visual" /> It was destroyed thirty [[Standard year|years]] after the [[Battle of Endor]], during a [[Cold War|conflict]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]]. The settlement was [[Attack on Tuanul|sacked]] by the First Order.<ref name="Episode VII">{{Film|VII}}</ref>

Another Sacred Village was inhabited by people who venerated the [[Hutt]]s as [[Deity|gods]]. Rumor had it that particular village was constructed around the gilded and bejewelled cranial mantle of [[Niima]] the Hutt herself.<ref name="Survival" />

